-- ============================================================
-- Migration 032: Delivery fallbacks for SeeClickFix-routed authorities
-- ============================================================
-- SeeClickFix now requires a personal access token to create issues
-- (anonymous POST → 401), and some seeded "SeeClickFix" cities have no
-- SeeClickFix organization at all (community map only — a post there never
-- reaches the city).
--
-- 1. Email fallbacks (priority 2) for the 98 largest SeeClickFix-only
--    authorities (population >= 100k), only where an official city page lists
--    a request inbox; web_form fallbacks (priority 3) for official portals.
-- 2. SeeClickFix API method removed for 25 authorities whose point
--    returns no city request types (checked read-only 2026-10-19).
-- Generated from research notes; sources are recorded in each method's notes.
-- ============================================================
